     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How to find your way",
     "texto": [
      "**Obok** and **naprzeciwko** («next to», «opposite») take the genitive. **Przez** («through») takes the accusative.",
      "To give a short instruction, you can use the imperative: **idź** («go»), **przejdź** («cross»). The context shows whether you are speaking informally or formally."
     ],
